  "title": "Orange Poppy Seed Zucchini Cake",
  "description": "Orange zest gives this moist orange poppy seed zucchini cake recipe a burst of citrus flavor, while dried fruit and poppy seeds add sweetness and texture.",
  "authors": [
    "Ginny Maziarka"
  ],
